# Saving a mission under a typed description: letters and digits in the edit
# box, Backspace, and Return, which the edit box takes for itself the first
# time (it only gives up the keyboard) so that it is the second that saves.
# Then the saved game in the load list, loaded with Return, and deleted again.
at 301 click 320 58
at 501 click 160 200
at 3001 key ESC
at 3041 click 320 170
at 3080 shot save_dialog
at 3081 type BEACH1X
at 3120 shot typed
at 3121 key BACKSPACE
at 3140 shot erased
at 3141 key RETURN
at 3160 shot edit_box_left
at 3161 key RETURN
at 3180 shot game_saved
at 3300 shot options_menu
at 3301 click 320 150
at 3340 shot load_list
at 3341 key RETURN
at 3500 shot loaded
at 3501 key ESC
at 3541 click 320 190
at 3580 shot delete_list
at 3581 key RETURN
at 3620 shot delete_query
at 3621 key RETURN
at 3660 shot deleted
at 3661 click 320 150
at 3700 shot no_saved_games
at 3701 quit
